lee-texparts.js, lee-board.js, lee-board.css, board/rough.js and board/perfect-freehand.mjs: the screen guide's formula parts and board, copied unchanged from the abhyasa checkout at abhyasa commit 66d3daf1c14472a38f7ea8d46d8e0b158bbc36ad (branch v0014-yt): abhyasa/core/texparts.js, abhyasa/core/board.js, abhyasa/core/board.css, abhyasa/core/vendor/rough.js and abhyasa/core/vendor/perfect-freehand.mjs. tests/test_vendor_board.py compares each file with `git show` of that commit and skips when the checkout or the commit is absent. When abhyasa 0.0.14 is released, its wheel is the source: this entry then names the wheel and its SHA-256, and the test compares against the files in the wheel. board/ is the folder the page passes to the board as `host.assets`, served at /leestatic/board/; board/LICENSES.md is abhyasa's licence file for the two libraries.

    git -C <abhyasa> show 66d3daf1c14472a38f7ea8d46d8e0b158bbc36ad:abhyasa/core/board.js > leela/vendor/lee-board.js

